# 19. AWS EC2

**Amazon EC2 (Elastic Compute Cloud)** provides virtual computers in the AWS cloud.

EC2 instances can be:

* Created
* Started
* Stopped
* Resized

as needed.

EC2 is an example of **IaaS** because users manage the operating system and applications running on the virtual machine.

